  {
    "id": "css-grid-two-column-blog",
    "metadata": {
      "title": "用 CSS Grid 搭一个稳定的两栏博客布局",
      "excerpt": "从 280px 侧栏和自适应正文开始，把间距、断点与内容密度一次理清。写布局时先把结构定下来，再处理视觉细节。",
      "date": "2026-10-20",
      "category": "前端",
      "tags": [
        "CSS",
        "布局"
      ],
      "cover": ""
    },
    "textSha256": "66d268148b8230877f1d86558ee7bdf4b2addee46fdc0b29370288330fa29079",
    "headings": [
      {
        "id": "layout",
        "text": "先确定内容的边界",
        "level": 2
      },
      {
        "id": "grid-minimum",
        "text": "为什么要写 minmax(0, 1fr)",
        "level": 3
      },
      {
        "id": "nested-layout",
        "text": "嵌套内容也需要边界",
        "level": 4
      },
      {
        "id": "responsive",
        "text": "断点由内容决定",
        "level": 2
      },
      {
        "id": "check-real-page",
        "text": "拿实际页面做检查",
        "level": 3
      },
      {
        "id": "state",
        "text": "让导航状态可以分享",
        "level": 2
      },
      {
        "id": "keyboard",
        "text": "用键盘检查一次",
        "level": 3
      },
      {
        "id": "finish",
        "text": "收尾：把简单的约定留下来",
        "level": 2
      }
    ],
    "code": [
      ".page {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 224px minmax(0, 1fr);\n  gap: 40px;\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin-inline: auto;\n  padding-inline: 32px;\n}\n\n.article {\n  min-width: 0;\n  max-width: 760px;\n}\n\npre {\n  overflow-x: auto;\n}",
      "const params = new URLSearchParams(location.search);\nconst postId = params.get('post');\nconst post = posts.find(item => item.id === postId);\n\nif (!post) {\n  showNotFound();\n} else {\n  renderArticle(post);\n}\n\n// 故意保留的长代码行：用于检查横向滚动，复制时应保持完整内容。\nconst example = 'https://example.com/articles/a-very-long-readable-identifier?layout=sidebar-and-reading-area&theme=follow-system&source=nekomi-reading-demo&check=horizontal-overflow';"
    ]
  },
