  {
    "id": "intersection-observer-sticky",
    "metadata": {
      "title": "IntersectionObserver 做吸顶，比监听 scroll 更省心",
      "excerpt": "用一个哨兵元素判断 Tabs 是否吸顶，只在状态变化时更新样式，滚动过程不再反复触发布局计算。",
      "date": "2026-10-11",
      "category": "前端",
      "tags": [
        "JavaScript",
        "浏览器"
      ],
      "cover": ""
    },
    "textSha256": "466d067d25ddcd93f3bceef0ac08eb39eb4432c8ec1e758ca04a5b108f93b3cd",
    "headings": [
      {
        "id": "css-first",
        "text": "先试 CSS sticky",
        "level": 2
      },
      {
        "id": "sentinel",
        "text": "确实需要状态时，再放一个哨兵",
        "level": 2
      },
      {
        "id": "limits",
        "text": "观察范围需要明确",
        "level": 3
      },
      {
        "id": "section",
        "text": "章节高亮是另一类需求",
        "level": 2
      }
    ],
    "code": [
      "const observer = new IntersectionObserver(([entry]) => {\n  nav.classList.toggle('is-stuck', !entry.isIntersecting);\n}, { threshold: 0 });\n\nobserver.observe(sentinel);\n// 销毁页面功能时：observer.disconnect();"
    ]
